摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness sidebar plugin: recent Workspace ordering, compact conversations with hover, running-task visibility, and scroll-to-selected. Available on npm.","id":"gh:1442508913","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-workspace-recent-sort","slug":"easychen/dsh-workspace-recent-sort","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","javascript","npm","sidebar","sort","workspace"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness sidebar plugin: recent Workspace ordering, compact conversations with hover, runnin"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"g-task visibility, and scroll-to-selected. Available on npm."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-workspace-recent-sort"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"npm: <https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-workspace-recent-sort>\nRepository: <https://github.com/easyc"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"hen/dsh-workspace-recent-sort>"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness sidebar plugin with three related behaviors:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"1. **WorkSpace groups follow “Last updated”** — a Workspace with a newer\nconversation rises to the t"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"op of the sidebar.\n2. **Compact Workspace conversations** — an expanded Workspace shows only its\nnew"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"est conversation; hovering reveals the next few with an animation.\n3. **Scroll back after a reorder*"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"* — when the automatic ordering moves groups,\nthe sidebar scrolls the currently selected conversatio"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"matic ordering moves groups,\nthe sidebar scrolls the currently selected conversation back into view."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The ordering and compact-display behaviors have switches in\n**Settings → 工作区 / Workspaces**."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## The problem"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"DSH's native **Order by → Last updated** sorts Sessions *inside* each\nWorkspace. Workspace groups th"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"emselves always render in the Host's durable\n`workspaceIds` order (the order produced by dragging fo"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"lders). A Workspace with\na brand-new conversation therefore stays wherever it was manually placed."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"This plugin leaves that durable order untouched. It only changes the browser\nprojection while, and o"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"nly while, both of these are selected:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Group by** = **WorkSpace** (按工作区)\n- **Order by** = **Last updated** (最近更新)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Behavior"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Recent ordering"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- Workspace groups are ordered by the newest `updatedAt` among their real\nconversations, newest firs"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"t. Archived conversations still count; a visible\narchived row is a real conversation.\n- Provisional "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"blank Sessions (the \"New Session\" placeholder) and hidden\nsubagent children do not count as conversa"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"tion activity.\n- Workspaces with no loaded conversation fall to the bottom. Ties keep the\nHost's rel"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ative order, so the result is deterministic.\n- Switching to **Manual** order (手动排序), **Workspace Tre"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"e** (按工作区树), or\nthe flat list restores the native order immediately.\n- No Host state is written: the"},{"id":"p13s7","text":" durable Workspace order is unchanged, no\nSession is moved, and there is no network request. Workspa"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"ce drag commits are\nsuppressed while **Last updated** is active, because a durable reorder would\nbe "},{"id":"p13s9","text":"invisible under the recency projection; switch to **Manual** to arrange\nfolders.\n- The plugin only w"},{"id":"p13s10","text":"raps the sidebar's registered `WorkspaceBrowser`. The\nWorkspace picker, search results, session rows"},{"id":"p13s11","text":", archive filters, pins, and\nsession drag behavior remain native."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Compact conversations"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- In **Group by → WorkSpace**, an expanded Workspace shows only its newest\nconversation row by defau"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"lt, plus any row that must stay actionable.\n- Hovering the Workspace header or its visible row anima"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"tes the next three\nconversations into view (the newest conversation plus three more; a\nprovisional N"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ew Session row stays visible when present). Moving away collapses\nthem again.\n- The currently select"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"ed conversation stays visible even when it is not the\nnewest one.\n- Rows with a running turn, a runn"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"ing subagent child, or a pending interaction\n(approval / plan review / question) are never hidden by"},{"id":"p15s7","text":" compact mode, even\nwhen several of them run at once.\n- The **展开其余 xx 个会话 / Show remaining … convers"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"ations** button stays\nhidden until the Workspace is hovered or keyboard-focused.\n- Keyboard focus in"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"side a Workspace expands all of its rendered rows. Clicking\n**展开其余 xx 个会话 / Show remaining … convers"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"ations** raises the native\nwatermark for that Workspace; once more than six rows are rendered, hover"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"ing\nreveals all of them.\n- Collapsed Workspaces, Workspace Tree mode, and the flat list keep their\nn"},{"id":"p15s12","text":" of them.\n- Collapsed Workspaces, Workspace Tree mode, and the flat list keep their\nnative behavior."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Scroll to the selected conversation"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"After any Workspace reorder changes the group order — the automatic recent\nordering, a sort-mode swi"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"tch, or a manual workspace drag — the plugin scrolls\nthe sidebar so the currently selected conversat"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ion is visible. If the row is\nalready visible, `block: \"nearest\"` leaves the scroll position alone."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Settings"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Settings → 工作区 / Workspaces** provides two switches:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Switch | Default | Effect |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| 按最近更新排序工作区 | On | Enable the recent-ordering projection. |\n| 工作区对话简约显示 | On | Enable the one-row c"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ompact display and hover reveal. |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Settings are browser-local (`dsh.workspace-recent-sort.settings.v1` in\n`localStorage`), so different"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" browsers can use different preferences. Toggles\napply immediately without a reload."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Install the published bundle from npm into the Web profile:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Or install directly from GitHub:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The package declares `dsh.bundle.patch`, so it installs as an active profile\nbundle. Restart `dsh we"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"b` if requested and refresh the Web page."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"For local development, link the checkout instead:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Then make sure `dsh-workspace-recent-sort` is present in\n`dsh.profile.bundles` in the profile's `pac"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ure `dsh-workspace-recent-sort` is present in\n`dsh.profile.bundles` in the profile's `package.json`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"To remove it:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The Plugins page / bundle installer offers the same install and removal\noperations."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Built against DSH `0.2.1-rc.2`. The native View-options menu has no public\nextension slot for group "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ordering, so the plugin uses the sidebar\nregistration's own component seam: it replaces `entry.compo"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"nent` with a wrapper\nthat preserves the entry's store, injected services, locale, and child-slot\naut"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"horization. Compact mode is CSS scoped under a data attribute and targets\nstructural `data-row-key` "},{"id":"p36s5","text":"attributes rather than hashed class names. If the\nsidebar shape is not recognized, the plugin leaves"},{"id":"p36s6","text":" the native component\nuntouched rather than failing application boot."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The browser bundle is hand-written against the DSH module loader, so no build\nstep is required."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Maintainers: see PUBLISHING.md for the npm release checklist."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
